---
import { CONTACT } from '../lib/seo'
export const prerender = true
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Cocosol Surf Lessons Cocoa Beach"
  description="Privacy Policy for Cocosol Surf Lessons. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you book surf lessons in Cocoa Beach, FL."
  slug="/privacy-policy"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl">

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: May 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
          <p>
            Cocosol Surf Lessons ("we," "our," or "us") is a surf school located in Cocoa Beach, Florida, USA.
            We offer surf lessons, surf camps, and surf packages. Our website is
            <a href="https://cocosolsurf.com" class="text-teal-600 hover:underline">https://cocosolsurf.com</a>.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">Contact: <a href="mailto:info@cocosolsurf.com" class="text-teal-600 hover:underline">info@cocosolsurf.com</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect information you provide directly when you:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Make a booking or reservation (name, email, phone number, number of participants)</li>
            <li>Contact us via WhatsApp or email</li>
            <li>Subscribe to our newsletter</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We may also collect non-personal technical data such as browser type, pages visited, and approximate location via cookies and analytics tools.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>To confirm and manage your bookings</li>
            <li>To send you booking confirmations and relevant updates</li>
            <li>To respond to your inquiries</li>
            <li>To send promotional emails if you opted in (you may unsubscribe at any time)</li>
            <li>To improve our website and services</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Payment Processing</h2>
          <p>
            Payments are processed through a trusted third-party payment processor.
            We do not store your full credit card details on our servers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            Our website uses cookies to improve your browsing experience. These include essential cookies (required for the site to function), analytics cookies (to understand how visitors use our site), and preference cookies.
            By using our site you consent to our use of cookies. You can control cookies through your browser settings.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>We may share your data with trusted third parties only as necessary to operate our business:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Payment processor</strong>, payment processing</li>
            <li><strong>Supabase</strong>, booking database</li>
            <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong>, website analytics (anonymized)</li>
            <li><strong>WhatsApp / Meta</strong>, customer communication</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            We retain your personal data for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this policy or as required by law.
            Booking records are kept for a minimum of 5 years for accounting and legal purposes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">8. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
            <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
            <li>Object to or restrict certain processing</li>
            <li>Data portability</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@cocosolsurf.com" class="text-teal-600 hover:underline">info@cocosolsurf.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">9. Security</h2>
          <p>
            We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, disclosure, or loss.
            However, no internet transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent changes.
            We encourage you to review this page periodically.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">11. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
          <ul class="list-none mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@cocosolsurf.com" class="text-teal-600 hover:underline">info@cocosolsurf.com</a></li>
            <li>Phone: <a href={CONTACT.TEL_HREF} class="text-teal-600 hover:underline">{CONTACT.DISPLAY}</a></li>
            <li>Address: 632 Adams Ave, Cape Canaveral, FL 32920</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/" class="text-sm text-teal-600 hover:underline font-medium">← Back to Home</a>
        <a href="/terms-of-use" class="text-sm text-teal-600 hover:underline font-medium">Terms of Use</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
